<title>USA: PerfectData to spin off Staruni.</title>
<headline>PerfectData to spin off Staruni.</headline>
<dateline>SIMI VALLEY, Calif. 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>PerfectData Corp said Tuesday it will spin off most of its interest in the Internet service provider Staruni Corp to its shareholders.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, 25 shares of Staruni will be distributed for each 100 PerfectData shares held.</p>
<p>PerfectData currently owns about one million shares, or 50 percent of Staruni. After the distribution it would own about 15 percent of the company's shares.</p>
<p>The distribution date was set for August 14 to shareholders of record July 17.</p>
